Here's the problem file for the task of placing cleaned lettuce on the countertop:

```pddl
(define (problem place_lettuce_problem)
  (:domain robot3)
  (:objects
    robot3 - robot
    lettuce - object
    counterTop - object
    sink - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot3 sink)
    (holding robot3 lettuce)
    (cleaned robot3 lettuce)
    (not (inaction robot3))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location lettuce counterTop)
    )
  )
)
